{"pdfData":[[{"bbox":[86,72,223,85],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"PPT1：引入：什么是点突变？","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"e49cb5de-26bc-4da5-8b6a-a000782813c2","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-0"},{"bbox":[86,88,505,116],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"同学们好，今天我们来讲新冠病毒进化最基础、最核心的机制 ——点突变驱动的适应性进化。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"4e11d9ff-445c-47a3-813c-d672bd673b4b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-1"},{"bbox":[86,119,505,163],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"点突变，就是病毒 RNA 在复制时，单个核苷酸发生替换，最终导致编码的氨基酸改变。它是 SARS-CoV-2 进化的基础驱动力，尤其集中在刺突蛋白受体结合域 RBD，这里承受着最强的正选择压力。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"bdb2b89f-f7f5-4a6d-b9b4-6afb7117b948","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-2"},{"bbox":[94,173,361,369],"type":"image","angle":0,"index":3,"img_path":"/fedf0474a7afbee0feee81f6c6a3ab0423355f0e40266d0d370b999e5cfb034e.jpg","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"img_ratio":0.44873949579831934,"page_idx":0,"id":"b777db91-afc7-4ee3-a380-e720d8d916aa","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-3"},{"bbox":[86,399,249,412],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":4,"text":"# PPT2：一、点突变的两大核心功能","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"e1b805e9-1473-4653-a784-269163afb427","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-4"},{"bbox":[87,415,398,428],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"点突变主要做两件事，直接决定病毒能不能传播、能不能逃避免疫：","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"d91df8b0-a463-48e4-a0ac-15b5bca3e190","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-5"},{"bbox":[104,431,505,475],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"1. 优化 ACE2 亲和力：让病毒更容易结合人体细胞受体。ACE2（血管紧张素转换酶 2）是一种广泛存在于人体细胞表面的跨膜蛋白，也是 SARS-CoV-2（新冠病毒）入侵人体细胞的关键受体","id":"f55de7e8-fa01-4a71-8eaa-70ac4edd7123","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-6"},{"bbox":[104,477,398,491],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"2. 实现免疫逃逸：让抗体认不出来，突破疫苗与既往感染免疫","id":"513e9808-8d51-4d73-9476-322e828c026e","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-7"},{"bbox":[87,742,285,756],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":12,"text":"# PPT3：二、关键突变：N501Y 的趋同进化","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"4232eb3c-b693-4954-b507-a845b6de7f50","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-8"}],[{"bbox":[86,72,211,85],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"最经典的例子就是 N501Y。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"b7cf788e-8b51-4204-8a56-5cb64442c5ce","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-0"},{"bbox":[86,88,463,101],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"它在 Alpha、Beta、Gamma 三个不同谱系独立出现、反复发生，这叫趋同进化。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"e116c0c5-e2f6-476f-a6ea-1c2362c192e9","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-1"},{"bbox":[86,103,464,117],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"功能非常明确：把 RBD 与 ACE2 的亲和力提高 2.1–3.5 倍，显著增强入侵能力。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"69d287f6-55c0-4b04-b615-91cf551c5a35","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-2"},{"bbox":[86,119,399,132],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"这就是自然选择最典型的证据：哪个突变有用，病毒就反复用哪个。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"e4a1906d-96e4-499f-9cf1-04bd0bf653a4","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-3"},{"bbox":[94,140,352,311],"type":"image","angle":0,"index":4,"img_path":"/2a40f3d55cacf7ef87e7fba53e1c565869cb3c2c7ce2cf7b4ce47bfb8f152703.jpg","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"img_ratio":0.4336134453781513,"page_idx":1,"id":"abd96822-8dad-4cb2-9bbf-e3405d76e215","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-4"},{"bbox":[92,325,499,346],"type":"image_caption","angle":0,"index":5,"text":"Figure1SARs-Cov-2genomemapindicatingthe locationsandencodedaminoacidchanges ofwhatweconsideredhere tobesignature mutations of V1,V2,and V3 sequences","id":"db66413c-2cd7-4271-94a0-1e0886ddec4a","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-5"},{"bbox":[92,350,449,361],"type":"image_caption","angle":0,"index":6,"text":"图1新冠病毒基因组图谱，标注了本研究中认定的V1、V2和V3序列特征突变的位置及其编码的氨基酸变化","id":"f63ddbad-099d-4e09-a051-12f0438bf09b","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-6"},{"bbox":[86,384,340,396],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":7,"text":"# PPT4：三、Omicron：从 “更强结合” 转向 “更强逃逸”","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"level":1,"page_idx":1,"id":"26a66673-8fcc-4fa9-8f28-a2b0e961a942","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-7"},{"bbox":[86,400,285,412],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"到了 Omicron，点突变策略发生关键转变：","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"dfa24391-bb3a-4bab-a5b1-26478c473854","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-8"},{"bbox":[86,415,464,428],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"不再一味追求更高 ACE2 亲和力，而是在维持结合的同时，优先选免疫逃逸突变。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"ec7f0b3d-867b-4402-bbe4-cda2d30f2680","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-9"},{"bbox":[87,431,115,443],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":10,"merge_prev":false,"text":"比如：","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"319f47f6-1ee5-4b73-aba7-71070e2dbab4","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-10"},{"bbox":[105,447,156,458],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"merge_prev":false,"text":". K417N","id":"f0f70512-6e73-434a-937f-e688ba73f8dd","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-11"},{"bbox":[105,463,155,474],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":13,"merge_prev":false,"text":"E484A","id":"b0863795-71f3-4271-b3a4-1285ae947a8a","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-12"},{"bbox":[105,478,157,490],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"merge_prev":false,"text":"Q493R","id":"c6b88c2a-eca9-4f30-ad06-305a1f0fcb95","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-13"},{"bbox":[86,492,398,506],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"merge_prev":false,"text":"这些突变不显著降低亲和力，但大幅改变抗原表位，躲开中和抗体。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"822fada4-4a88-4d44-beb8-d8e71ee66b63","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-14"}],[{"bbox":[86,72,506,132],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"RBD 中测得的奥密克戎 BA.1 每个单 RBD 替换对 ACE2 结合亲和力[Δlog10(Kd)]的单独效应的累积叠加。即使背景中的参考状态不同，突变效应也按标注方向计算；例如，Beta 背景中的 N501Y 效应与测得的 Y501N 突变效应符号相反。红线表示武汉-Hu-1 的亲和力，星号表示奥密克戎 BA.1 RBD 相对于武汉-Hu-1 的实际亲和力","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"cc1ebb42-7422-46b8-8425-f49647bb7fcb","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-0"},{"bbox":[86,150,315,163],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"PPT5：四、免疫缺陷宿主：点突变的 “进化工厂”","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"b22bb439-487d-4640-aac3-7604fc402af1","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-1"},{"bbox":[86,165,347,179],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"综述里特别强调：免疫低下人群是病毒突变的重要来源。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"8a3a8d61-2ec3-4235-ac70-39ef66227bbc","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-2"},{"bbox":[86,181,504,210],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"比如 HIV 共感染、长期使用免疫抑制剂的患者，病毒可以在体内持续存活数月，进化速率比普通感染快得多，积累大量突变。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"727acbc3-eea7-41f3-aba8-f7ea991f03be","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-3"},{"bbox":[86,212,504,226],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"这些人相当于病毒的体内进化温床，源源不断产生新突变，最终扩散到人群，形成新变异株。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"9858a82e-37de-4c80-a3b6-b989ee4ac952","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-4"},{"bbox":[86,243,291,257],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"PPT6：五、上位性效应：突变不是单打独斗","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"c0fe1667-98d3-478b-a8ed-ba0001282cb6","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-5"},{"bbox":[86,259,305,272],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"点突变还有一个高级玩法：上位性（epistasis）。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"ba3873af-4d95-4f7b-b2bc-2a5cfef1c761","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-6"},{"bbox":[86,275,315,288],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"意思是：一个突变的效果，依赖其他突变的背景。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"bbd70d6f-d518-43be-98f9-e31810254488","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-7"},{"bbox":[86,290,504,318],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"比如 Q493E 这个突变，在早期毒株里作用很小，但在 Omicron 背景下，能大幅增强免疫逃逸。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"fd133680-2b04-48f7-af65-fa4c021cbcdd","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-8"},{"bbox":[87,322,453,335],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"多个突变组合起来，实现 1+1>2 的效果，这是 Omicron 如此成功的关键之一。","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"6fc2455e-0e8c-468c-9166-ed2d5273e62f","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-9"},{"bbox":[86,571,426,584],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"merge_prev":false,"text":"间的正上位相互作用。星号表示假设加性效应时预期的双突变结合亲和力","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"9105610e-ee16-4311-bef2-42cf806f6062","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-10"},{"bbox":[86,602,506,631],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":13,"merge_prev":false,"text":"回到 PPT4，Omicron 这么多突变加起来，在原始株背景下亲和力会掉到很低，但在有 N501Y的 Beta 背景下就能维持正常亲和力，这就是上位性效应带来的 “亲和力缓冲”","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"33f4def6-daf6-4223-9522-7f600005ba4d","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-11"},{"bbox":[86,664,239,677],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"merge_prev":false,"text":"PPT7：总结：点突变的核心地位","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"97ab1b8a-ffac-4c81-a59f-44c3c9f2106c","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-12"},{"bbox":[87,680,157,692],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"merge_prev":false,"text":"最后做个小结：","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"37b6f8ac-fd0e-42fa-aa85-c14eeef89a19","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-13"},{"bbox":[104,696,262,708],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":17,"merge_prev":false,"text":"1. 点突变是新冠进化的基础引擎","id":"39e3745c-7d81-4112-98b0-46706808dd4b","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-14"},{"bbox":[104,711,294,724],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":18,"merge_prev":false,"text":"2. RBD 是热点区域，负责入侵 + 逃逸","id":"4b74db03-acbe-4d4a-b187-4043e20efcef","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-15"},{"bbox":[105,727,235,739],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":19,"merge_prev":false,"text":"3. N501Y 是趋同进化典范","id":"43ad7177-e238-4f07-8a8b-809b99748661","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-16"},{"bbox":[104,743,285,755],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":20,"merge_prev":false,"text":"4. Omicron 靠突变组合实现高效逃逸","id":"fb9df47a-e034-4f7f-bbf7-017ff67218fd","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-17"}],[{"bbox":[105,72,252,85],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"5. 免疫缺陷宿主加速突变产生","id":"96590c24-20ba-408e-9141-7c1063caf417","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-0"},{"bbox":[106,88,242,100],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"6. 上位性让病毒进化更灵活","id":"02d92cf5-b682-432f-9455-9cf86215cd01","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":3,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"3-1"}]],"mergeConnections":[]}